message: "If you use GpFlash, please cite the paper below."
type: software
title: GpFlash
abstract: >-
  Header-only C++ library for exact, dense Gaussian process regression: the marginal log
  likelihood with analytic hyperparameter gradients, hyperparameter fitting, and posterior
  mean and variance, with Python bindings.
authors:
